#: ../../source/docs/common-sbus-out.rst:4 1baca0eaa74f43bfa45943ed472f68e6
#: 29ed7f86a3d641d6b596abf25d91d65f 7110f39ed967497eb26398afb4f4dea7
#: 89c8a62bc9cf4eccb27e05cb6580d34e e9db2d962f724564bb753029d4627d1f
msgid "SBus Servos"
msgstr "SBUS舵机"

#: ../../source/docs/common-sbus-out.rst:9 05826d7c951a49be87fc1166b7b2b049
#: 10f79c14d00b44509337b56d22edaed8 4ce75425e0a34714b4649cf23acd0b16
#: ada7ecf3daa14697a739df2c59b9335a d57ad6abaad346f9a2bf415dbb1ff13e
msgid ""
"`Futaba SBus/SBus2 servos <https://www.futabarc.com/servos/sbus.html>`__ "
"accept the serial `SBus protocol <https://www.futabarc.com/sbus/>`__ and can"
" be controlled by ArduPilot once connected to the autopilot's \"SB\" port or"
" any other serial port.  Up to 16 servos can be daisy chained together "
"meaning that instead of each servo being directly connected to the "
"autopilot, only a single serial connection from the autopilot is required."
msgstr ""
"`Futaba SBus/SBus2舵机 <https://www.futabarc.com/servos/sbus.html>`__ 接受串行 "
"`SBus协议 "
"<https://www.futabarc.com/sbus/>`__，连接到飞控的「SB」端口或任何其他串行端口后可由ArduPilot控制。最多可以菊花链方式连接16个舵机，这意味着不需要每个舵机直接连接到飞控，只需从飞控引出一根串行线即可。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-sbus-out.rst:11 0d12b343298d4e0483a74da9723a166f
#: 1be367af896147788c04b28745774da9 53afa03479ff4eaaba216e2bbc073225
#: 7b1c1a6a286c4f589ca8d3b0a9ead0f6 8dd81401c8014b86a96d2c9f65973e76
msgid "The transmission rate is 100K baud."
msgstr "传输速率为100K波特。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-sbus-out.rst:14 92da9fdb05af419fa6fd364ebdbfed0d
#: 9a6f68cb775e4addb222cfdfb3f905e3 bdda44dd602e49e087b3d12e70787f75
#: bf2a45feec594d279af47d0741f37f50 f70dba931794413b98bb4ffc815d925a
msgid "Where to Buy"
msgstr "购买渠道"

#: ../../source/docs/common-sbus-out.rst:16 069ad66f84c34129b0a24c2e6111feb1
#: 0d0d10367fcf47acba94bf912494ffdf 5d040dc0f52341b0a89e1881dfc95590
#: 9d3146b0c620464cabe7cd4ea49b3f85 e1a68f68634d41efaec221d48e4e71a8
msgid ""
"Available from many online retailers including `Amazon.com "
"<https://www.amazon.com/s/ref=nb_sb_noss?url=srs&field-"
"keywords=s-bus+servo>`__"
msgstr ""
"可从多家在线零售商购买，包括 `Amazon.com "
"<https://www.amazon.com/s/ref=nb_sb_noss?url=srs&field-"
"keywords=s-bus+servo>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/common-sbus-out.rst:17 1733ce68ceca4b2f8f877dd3afd7070f
#: 6f8c824d847144758bf79386b10ac008 7df5163a7c694d758799d03008d0e8c2
#: c233af38ca964eb8aaae5685f828f0cc eb8af4abc69f4fa1a74cb4fd43667e82
msgid ""
"The `Futaba CIU-3 USB Interface <https://www.amazon.com/FUTABA-"
"BB1166-CIU-3-USB-Interface/dp/B01I4KQ0QA/ref=sr_1_19?>`__ is also "
"recommended to allow easy configuration of the servos (`online manual "
"<http://manuals.hobbico.com/fut/ciu-3-manual.pdf>`__)"
msgstr ""
"还推荐使用 `Futaba CIU-3 USB接口 <https://www.amazon.com/FUTABA-BB1166-CIU-3-USB-"
"Interface/dp/B01I4KQ0QA/ref=sr_1_19?>`__ 以方便舵机配置（`在线手册 "
"<http://manuals.hobbico.com/fut/ciu-3-manual.pdf>`__）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-sbus-out.rst:20 1d53cfb072bf441eb45c7a472874d59c
#: 66bd189d432e42ba9ea0b6dd7c260031 685af111e8074de48874a3baa714b3f7
#: 73714bf246834e1399347b9cb3b51d81 c423fe4a438a4b78a236e29705ba4d4d
msgid "Configuring the Servos"
msgstr "舵机配置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-sbus-out.rst:22 3310bc2761a449f194e994be4654ea8a
#: 4c4b488ba3b34256b35597eb7ebb2499 aa392efcb36c48a1902ba8d579644243
#: b2224bab22324d55952323218443a22b f33b01b0e3234ea3b8329f5e3351503d
msgid ""
"Each servo's ID needs to be set to a number from 1 to 16.  The number chosen"
" should correspond to the servo number used to configure and control the "
"servo from within ArduPilot.  For example if the ID is set to \"9\", the "
":ref:`SERVO9_MIN <SERVO9_MIN>`, :ref:`SERVO9_MAX <SERVO9_MAX>`, "
":ref:`SERVO9_FUNCTION <SERVO9_FUNCTION>`, etc parameters will be used to "
"configure the servo."
msgstr ""
"每个舵机的ID需要设置为1到16之间的数字。选择的数字应对应ArduPilot中用于配置和控制该舵机的舵机编号。例如，如果ID设置为「9」，则使用 "
":ref:`SERVO9_MIN <SERVO9_MIN>`、:ref:`SERVO9_MAX "
"<SERVO9_MAX>`、:ref:`SERVO9_FUNCTION <SERVO9_FUNCTION>` 等参数来配置该舵机。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-sbus-out.rst:24 09915e3f85364c60a08b1cf5aa9aeaac
#: 5a244c46d18e49dc9c06478a35bbb6b9 70a7ef8904354dbc88f3b7c9278c1745
#: dd6643e8e63a449292289c0426b9282f ecde895094f548469ce1ba2ce3ad9f9a
msgid ""
"Connect the servo the Futuba CIU-3 USB Interface dongle (`online manual "
"<http://manuals.hobbico.com/fut/ciu-3-manual.pdf>`__) and plug the dongle "
"into a Windows PC.  A prompt should appear to download and install the "
"required drivers"
msgstr ""
"将舵机连接到Futaba CIU-3 USB接口加密狗（`在线手册 "
"<http://manuals.hobbico.com/fut/ciu-3-manual.pdf>`__）并将加密狗插入Windows "
"PC，应出现下载和安装所需驱动程序的提示。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-sbus-out.rst:25 41d844bd5bc24e1196efda0b40f316cd
#: 79903c6b13134e64a9d9f62dc24ab0bb a695697520f14b34a89adb5623ee1883
#: ba8f26f65956490f90ba439974649337 be9d9a457f7d4541b5137bbb2bfac743
msgid ""
"Download and install the S-Link software (`search for \"S-Link\" here "
"<https://www.futabarc.com/software-updates.html>`__)"
msgstr ""
"下载并安装S-Link软件（`在此搜索「S-Link」 <https://www.futabarc.com/software-"
"updates.html>`__）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-sbus-out.rst:26 57e0f2809d9440b3a81184328d525edb
#: 6f142f4d150a424caccf90754163069e 710ed677a174423d8bf40e36ec0e7bc9
#: b9efa6a7919946f4b37faf341d7d76bf c158a5eab0964e4abff2f966fa54e9c3
msgid ""
"Use S-Link to set each servo's ID (`online instructions "
"<http://downloads.hobbico.com/software/fut/S_Link_Manual-ENG.pdf>`__)"
msgstr ""
"使用S-Link设置每个舵机的ID（`在线说明 "
"<http://downloads.hobbico.com/software/fut/S_Link_Manual-ENG.pdf>`__）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-sbus-out.rst:32 3b33e96eb1914e2e919464acef4f56a9
#: 561d5e665e8e40d8a6aaac614f7be449 a0c77b8d657e48498b524175b03e2a43
#: bf503b86b1824186a9843c07923f741b e751cc94078042e4bf78ef9701828e49
msgid "*image courtesy of Futaba.com*"
msgstr "*图片由Futaba.com提供*"

#: ../../source/docs/common-sbus-out.rst:35 4752aac503b14c3099eeb9a1960d89f2
#: 5d34707fcb524694a8c9da7590222099 bc5dc89064b44c86b622c82b6f206cac
#: d7a6847211f542ac8ca98cf4856e0cca e8dbb46d4a0843baba9aeed845660ce1
msgid "Connecting Servos to a Autopilot"
msgstr "将舵机连接到飞控"

#: ../../source/docs/common-sbus-out.rst:41 345ae6ad5e5b4c6889c7484f343ab599
#: bfcc2607faf842619fbf0bc1086fd039 c93ce8e8479a4d03a747aabfb04ca3da
#: d6f56497f4784a5d94b677bd4ebb18eb f2c213e1638744cc9e1276bb1e3d62b6
msgid ""
"If using an autopilot with a designated \"SBUS out\" pin ,connect the servo "
"to that port on the autopilot.  For Cube autopilots use the \"SBUSo\" port."
"  For other autopilots without these connectors see the instructions below. "
"The :ref:`BRD_SBUS_OUT<BRD_SBUS_OUT>` parameter must be enabled (=1)."
msgstr ""
"如果飞控有专用「SBUS "
"out」引脚，将舵机连接到飞控上的该端口。Cube飞控使用「SBUSo」端口。对于没有这些接口的其他飞控，请参阅以下说明。必须启用 "
":ref:`BRD_SBUS_OUT<BRD_SBUS_OUT>` 参数（=1）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-sbus-out.rst:43 073ec00c30b549a19bda5442fc8522da
#: 9088717ee2964354bf8bd7192280f9cb a3150a2613284e67a05c015bf43c77c7
#: ba900d9a4bff42ff89abae7a53984737 f8c8d5baf33e4728bf46fea0fb3f9d18
msgid ""
"On some autopilots, this pin has a shared function with analog RSSI input by"
" setting :ref:`RSSI_ANA_PIN<RSSI_ANA_PIN>` to this pin. These functions "
"cannot be used simultaneously."
msgstr ""
"在某些飞控上，该引脚通过将 :ref:`RSSI_ANA_PIN<RSSI_ANA_PIN>` "
"设置为该引脚与模拟RSSI输入共享功能。这两个功能不能同时使用。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-sbus-out.rst:45 48bf3b7719d343b4a040b38b08a28ec6
#: 7abb2623595c480494a3901a478235d0 8bfd580d241d411783c2ff9d9531f5d3
#: de22edc180f6476e86bbc47fc4b7e5a4 e7c84554e4034d8cbe59f959fc33de8e
msgid ""
":ref:`SERVO_SBUS_RATE <SERVO_SBUS_RATE>` controls the update rate to the "
"servos.  The default is 50 Hz but can be set to any value in the range of 25"
" Hz to 250 Hz"
msgstr ""
":ref:`SERVO_SBUS_RATE <SERVO_SBUS_RATE>` 控制舵机的更新频率。默认为50 Hz，但可设置为25 Hz至250 "
"Hz范围内的任意值。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-sbus-out.rst:48 3c98e89f447745059568437cd3389014
#: 5f7ec7d12c4b4376a6596233fa6e41ae 901debe8393c4e5087b8ea9a76ce5a47
#: 9d69ca6d7c2b4e018e90de7483a7f144 ebbbce2aba2e4e6e8018df6ee9e6485b
msgid "Connecting Servos to a Serial Port"
msgstr "将舵机连接到串行端口"

#: ../../source/docs/common-sbus-out.rst:50 00bc4297de4b4774aadaacbe6f23eecf
#: 8accc72364b048bda42bc4f400e4644f a1a406f109b74f19b555058454a3a15b
#: afbba4b68dd34ac392098626995e2ecb d7894d22569d4d8092a410c049ebf75b
msgid ""
"SBus servos can also be controlled from any of the autopilot's serial ports."
" The protocol uses inverted logic levels (unidirectional: output only) "
"meaning an inverting cable is required when using a standard serial port, if"
" the autopilot is not capable of internally inverting the signals. "
"Autopilots using an F7 or H7 processor can internally invert the serial "
"port's TX pin. Below is a diagram showing a simple NPN transistor inverter "
"which will suffice:"
msgstr ""
"SBUS舵机也可通过飞控的任意串行端口控制。该协议使用反转逻辑电平（单向：仅输出），这意味着使用标准串行端口时，如果飞控无法内部反转信号，则需要反相电缆。使用F7或H7处理器的飞控可以内部反转串行端口的TX引脚。以下是一个简单NPN三极管反相器示意图，可满足需求："

#: ../../source/docs/common-sbus-out.rst:56 26d676124e8f41b9bb8d27720b6eb6f6
#: 4c15e51abf03464d9643528eb04c0c8b 7df067f9bf2644499b779bf29f3d0964
#: acd5a9acf1174397bc4dcab2d0483aff e9d0e0397ea946dfa06c80efbc7dfbb2
msgid ""
"Alternatively, a commercial `SPort inverter "
"<https://www.amazon.com/Telemetry-Converter-Pixhawk-Taranis-"
"Receiver/dp/B07KJFWTCB>`__ can be used, as shown below:"
msgstr ""
"也可使用市售 `SPort反相器 <https://www.amazon.com/Telemetry-Converter-Pixhawk-"
"Taranis-Receiver/dp/B07KJFWTCB>`__，如下图所示："

#: ../../source/docs/common-sbus-out.rst:60 4466135b47a34a7da9225b84ec14180a
#: 64c6b3c5c0aa4fd9b7620f0e9ff2073b 98b1bb8a68c449e08789da4fb990d04d
#: 9e5896a5fe4f414a863a3ec7f6a4226b f472b6ff28ab44a4b53680f873ee1b4b
msgid ""
"do not power the servo from the serial port's 5V, use the systems servo "
"power bus!"
msgstr "请勿从串行端口的5V为舵机供电，应使用系统舵机电源总线！"

#: ../../source/docs/common-sbus-out.rst:62 2f3f32c1f7354aa7a953edcf4224c343
#: 38d9e73997414bdc8519bbe4951b3f38 db26747bd01d4457b349fc83bcbbc8f6
#: edc9e25fb68f45baa2ecf449924b7b04 f9cc1d041ced40f1815905ecc12ed170
msgid ""
"Set the :ref:`SERIAL2_PROTOCOL <SERIAL2_PROTOCOL>` = 15 (\"SBUS servo out\")"
" if using Serial2 (normally TELEM2).  For other serial ports use the "
"appropriate ``SERIALx_PROTOCOL`` parameter."
msgstr ""
"使用Serial2（通常为TELEM2）时，将 :ref:`SERIAL2_PROTOCOL <SERIAL2_PROTOCOL>` "
"设置为15（「SBUS servo out」）。对于其他串行端口，使用相应的 ``SERIALx_PROTOCOL`` 参数。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-sbus-out.rst:63 414cdb4b18bd4b2a8098d2ae1008e2e6
#: 6ee3d7af9dcd4df9b44582adfd638534 90e1fdd0a9184916b89d638c5c34abf2
#: bc3eb874878c4ce88e81be4217d9599e fe0a2c406a1d4843bc14975c207810b4
msgid ""
"The port's baud rate parameter (in this case :ref:`SERIAL2_BAUD "
"<SERIAL2_BAUD>` ) will automatically be set to 100,000"
msgstr "端口的波特率参数（此处为 :ref:`SERIAL2_BAUD <SERIAL2_BAUD>`）将自动设置为100,000。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-sbus-out.rst:64 3103878fe12e4d07ab2a8049c237951d
#: 35a3cc2b1b304c4897de48313a5d9efa 615a4316a75b4727b321a304aedf7502
#: b9a3b7f80c3642c2b0eaf27e829b9a96 cf85f5314c314722980edbe2d8d6203a
msgid ""
"For F7/H7 processors an inverter is unnecessary, set "
":ref:`SERIAL2_OPTIONS<SERIAL2_OPTIONS>` bit 1  to \"1\" (TX invert) if "
"connecting to Serial port 2."
msgstr ""
"对于F7/H7处理器，无需反相器，如果连接到串行端口2，将 :ref:`SERIAL2_OPTIONS<SERIAL2_OPTIONS>` "
"第1位设置为「1」（TX反转）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-sbus-out.rst:67 21091dcecded4b488f8ce6f2dd6fa902
#: 725278daf3164471b7feb07d143414c8 a87668c68841409e8e92091149e8d944
#: cb75726a08bb4823bac14d72a51470d5 d0f49338e2b3490aa3f48dcef208966d
msgid "SBUS to PWM Decoders"
msgstr "SBUS转PWM解码器"

#: ../../source/docs/common-sbus-out.rst:69 b5de5e6d240848e197151a51b68e82fa
#: caf2479111ed4e2896ec547b57b02929 cd867e0b4af747d6afd03b4ae45ef85c
#: cdd4fc6ee46d464f9e0bc4428458b376 d8b19a927d61402f86c98cf751d5bd7a
msgid ""
"SBus to PWM decoders allow using the SBus interface with regular PWM servos "
"but beware that some decoders including the `FrSky SBUS & CCPM Decoder "
"<https://alofthobbies.com/frsky-sbus-cppm-decoder-with-pins.html>`__ "
"generate a fixed PWM output rate (~170 Hz) that may damage analog servos "
"(digital servos should be fine)"
msgstr ""
"SBUS转PWM解码器允许将SBus接口与普通PWM舵机一起使用，但请注意某些解码器（包括 `FrSky SBUS & CCPM Decoder "
"<https://alofthobbies.com/frsky-sbus-cppm-decoder-with-"
"pins.html>`__）会产生固定PWM输出频率（约170 Hz），可能会损坏模拟舵机（数字舵机应无问题）。"
